<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gurbanguly Berdimuhamedow</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1957">1957</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Gurbanguly Berdimuhamedow is a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turkmen">Turkmen</a> politician, a dentist by training, who became President of Turkmenistan after the death of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saparmurat-niyazov">Saparmurat Niyazov</a> in 2006. He ruled as an authoritarian leader and built a personality cult of his own, with the title Arkadag (Protector). In 2022 he was succeeded by his son Serdar and became chairman of the People's Council, keeping great influence.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/gurbanguly-berdimuhamedow.jpg" alt="Gurbanguly Berdimuhamedow" width="320" height="429" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Пресс-служба Президента Республики Татарстан · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%93%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B3%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8B_%D0%91%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B4%D1%8B%D0%BC%D1%83%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B2_-_02_(27-09-2025)_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
